<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Print your QR card · {{NAME}}</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="icon" href="{{ICON}}">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@62..125,100..900&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/tq.css">
<style>
  .qc { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 16px 80px; }
  .qc-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .qc h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 42px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .qc-lead { margin: 12px 0 0; max-width: 38em; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .qc-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0 28px; }
  .qc h2.qc-sub { font-size: clamp(21px, 3vw, 25px); line-height: 1.15; margin: 40px 0 6px; }
  .qc-note { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .qc-box { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .qc-text { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .qc-box .btn { margin-top: 12px; }
  .qc-list { margin: 10px 0 0; padding-left: 1.3em; }
  .qc-list li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .qc-list li + li { margin-top: 6px; }
  .qc-list b { color: var(--ink); }
  .qc-foot { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--faint); font-size: 14px; }
  .qc-foot a { color: var(--accent-text); }

  /* The card itself: black on white at every size, so it prints and scans the same everywhere. */
  .qc-card {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: #fff; color: #13231b; border: 6px solid #13231b; border-radius: 22px;
    max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8% 7% 6%; text-align: center;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0;
    break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .qc-brand { font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(22px, 5vw, 30px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0; }
  .qc-brand img { display: block; max-height: 64px; max-width: 70%; margin: 0 auto; }
  .qc-head { font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 46px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin: 5% 0 0; color: #0f5a43; }
  .qc-qr { width: 100%; margin: 6% 0 0; line-height: 0; }
  .qc-qr svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .qc-how { margin: 5% 0 0; font-size: clamp(15px, 3.4vw, 19px); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; max-width: 22em; }
  .qc-minor { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: clamp(13px, 2.8vw, 15.5px); line-height: 1.4; color: #3a4a41; max-width: 26em; }
  .qc-phone { margin: 5% 0 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(18px, 4vw, 23px); }
  .qc-url { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: clamp(12px, 2.6vw, 14.5px); color: #3a4a41; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  @page { size: letter; margin: 0.5in; }
  @media print {
    html, body { background: #fff !important; }
    * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
    .qc { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
    .qc-print-hide { display: none !important; }
    .qc-card { max-width: none; width: 100%; padding: 0.4in 0.6in 0.35in; border-width: 0.07in; border-radius: 0.3in; }
    .qc-brand { font-size: 0.4in; }
    .qc-brand img { max-height: 0.8in; }
    .qc-head { font-size: 0.5in; margin-top: 0.2in; }
    .qc-qr { width: 4.7in; margin-top: 0.25in; }
    .qc-how { font-size: 0.23in; margin-top: 0.25in; }
    .qc-minor { font-size: 0.18in; }
    .qc-phone { font-size: 0.28in; margin-top: 0.22in; }
    .qc-url { font-size: 0.18in; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<!-- Generated by tools/new-client.mjs from clients/{{ID}}.json. Edit the JSON and regenerate instead of editing this file. -->
<main class="qc">
  <div class="qc-top qc-print-hide">
    <a class="cq-name" href="./">{{NAME}}</a>
    <a class="cq-call" href="./" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open your quote page</a>
  </div>

  <div class="qc-print-hide">
    <h1>Your QR card</h1>
    <p class="qc-lead">Anyone who scans the code on this card opens your quote page on their phone. Print it and put it where homeowners already look.</p>
    <div class="qc-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="print-card">Print the card</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="qc-card" aria-label="Printable QR card">
    <p class="qc-brand">{{BRAND_HTML}}</p>
    <h2 class="qc-head">{{CARD_HEAD}}</h2>
    <div class="qc-qr">{{QR_SVG}}</div>
    <p class="qc-how">Point your phone's camera at the code.</p>
    <p class="qc-minor">{{CARD_MINOR}}</p>
    {{CARD_PHONE}}
    <p class="qc-url">{{SHORT_URL}}</p>
  </section>

  <div class="qc-print-hide">
    <h2 class="qc-sub">Where to use it</h2>
    <ul class="qc-list">
      <li><b>On your truck or in a window.</b> Print it at full size and slide it into a clear sleeve, or have a print shop laminate it.</li>
      <li><b>With every estimate and invoice.</b> Put a smaller copy next to your phone number.</li>
      <li><b>At a finished job.</b> Neighbors who see the fence can scan on the spot.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="qc-note">Print the code at least 3 inches wide. As a rule of thumb, a code scans from about ten times its width away, so a 3 inch code works from about 30 inches.</p>

    <h2 class="qc-sub">Text it to someone who asked about a fence</h2>
    <p class="qc-note">When a homeowner calls, messages you, or leaves a voicemail, send this back. The link opens the same quote page your website uses.</p>
    <div class="qc-box">
      <p class="qc-text" id="text-line">{{TEXT_LINE}}</p>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" type="button" data-copy="text-line">Copy text</button>
    </div>

    <p class="qc-foot">Questions, or want a card with your logo? Email <a href="mailto:hello@gettracequote.com">hello@gettracequote.com</a>. Quote tool by TraceQuote.</p>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
(function () {
  "use strict";
  document.getElementById("print-card").addEventListener("click", function () { window.print(); });
  document.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
    var b = e.target.closest("[data-copy]");
    if (!b) return;
    var el = document.getElementById(b.getAttribute("data-copy"));
    var done = function () {
      var old = b.textContent;
      b.textContent = "Copied";
      setTimeout(function () { b.textContent = old; }, 1600);
    };
    var select = function () {
      var r = document.createRange(); r.selectNodeContents(el);
      var s = window.getSelection(); s.removeAllRanges(); s.addRange(r);
    };
    if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) navigator.clipboard.writeText(el.textContent).then(done, select);
    else select();
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
